, "slug": "dead-space--1", "storyline": "Isaac Clarke is an everyman engineer on a mission to repair a vast, sprawling starship, the USG Ishimura, only to discover something has gone horribly wrong. The ship's crew has been slaughtered and infected by some alien scourge...and Isaac\u2019s beloved partner, Nicole, is lost somewhere on board.\n\nNow Isaac is alone with only his tools and engineering skills as he attempts to uncover the nightmarish mystery of what happened aboard the Ishimura. Trapped with hostile creatures called \u201cnecromorphs\u201d, Isaac faces a battle for survival, not only against the escalating terrors of the ship, but his own crumbling sanity.", "summary": "The sci-fi survival-horror classic Dead Space returns, completely rebuilt from the ground up to offer a deeper, more immersive experience. This remake brings jaw-dropping visual fidelity, suspenseful atmospheric audio, and improvements to gameplay while staying faithful to the original game\u2019s thrilling vision.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}, {"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}, {"id": 21, "name": "Survival"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/dead-space--1", "videos": [{"id": 52491, "name": "Teaser", "video_id": "l5WeBNfX-og", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=l5WeBNfX-og", "title": "Dead Space Official Teaser Trailer \u2013 EA Play Live 2021", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/l5WeBNfX-og/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 75869, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "cTDJNZ9cK1w", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cTDJNZ9cK1w", "title": "Dead Space Official Gameplay Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/cTDJNZ9cK1w/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 76442, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "96yUNw2zfW4", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=96yUNw2zfW4", "title": "Dead Space | Extended Gameplay Walkthrough", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/96yUNw2zfW4/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 82204, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "ctQl9wa3ydE", "url